 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Grace?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"It's my aunt, Grace. Went in the Taking. She laughed like a screen door in a windstorm. Boring. Right. Some nights I dream about the pods -- rows of them, humming. I wake up and I can't tell if it was a dream or a broadcast.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? That matters to me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"We lost Karen and Sean. I do the headcount without thinking. Then I think.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Sean said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Probably — It's stupid. I'm alive, everyone's alive, and I can't stop shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "Farid has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Hah. I — yeah. It helps, hearing that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Good. Company's company.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Mm. It helps. Just — saying it out loud to someone who's actually listening. It helps.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Still on that hard time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Out there? With YOU leading? ...Let me think about it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? Give it time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Karen is gone and Sean is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"I sharpen sticks down to nothing. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"My wound needs a second pair of hands. Could you clean it out for me? Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Ruth always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Ruth and I never finished talking about what's been happening — we got cut off, 4 days back. You're wearing Ruth's shoes now — want to pick it up? 'You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory.…'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I'm picking up Ruth's share of the work. Someone should, and it might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I think — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind? Just my read.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"I dreamed Ruth was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You show them Cattail — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Let me sit with all that. We'll pick it up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  }
 ],
